  "bodyHash": "f5cf0d072187141a",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">本模组为 Macaw's Bridges 与 Biomes O' Plenty 之间添加了兼容性。你是否一直梦想着用樱花木建造桥梁、屋顶或楼梯……现在，借助本模组，这一切都成为可能！</span></p>\n<p><em>我之前已经安装了 Macaw's Bridges/Fences/Roofs/Furnitures - BOP，我担心安装此模组会删除我已经放置好的所有桥梁。</em></p>\n<p>请放心，</p>\n<p>对于 Forge 版本，本模组会自动转换旧兼容性中的所有旧方块和物品。</p>\n<p>对于 Fabric 版本，需配合一个模组使用预填好的配置文件来自动替换方块。这些文件会在游戏启动时自动生成（与配置文件类似）——更多信息请查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></p>\n<p>对于 NeoForge 1.20.6 版本，转换功能暂无法使用，这是 NeoForge 本身的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>本模组支持：</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw's Bridges</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/10/2025-02-06_21-46-35-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Roofs</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/12/2025-02-08_00-03-38-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Fences</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/17/2025-02-08_00-06-53-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Furnitures</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/11/2025-02-06_21-48-31-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Stairs</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/19/2025-02-08_00-21-41-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Doors</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/18/2025-02-08_00-13-34-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Trapdoors</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/20/368347203-e94d95f4-d581-47ac-99e9-f72083d106e3-png.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/13/2025-02-08_00-03-47-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Paths</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/33/2025-02-08_01-23-05-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Windows</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/14/2025-02-08_00-03-53-png.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/16/2025-02-08_00-04-04-png.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/15/2025-02-08_00-03-59-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>依赖项（必需）：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong></p>\n<p>Terrablender（1.18.2+ 需要）：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GlitchCore</a>（1.20.1+ 需要，适用于 FORGE / FABRIC / NEOFORGE）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>依赖项（可选）：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconfigurable-everything\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Everything</a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
